<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Thank You from Yaziz</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom right, #00ffe0, #00c891);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      height: 100vh;
      overflow: hidden;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .container {
      animation: fadeIn 1.5s ease-in-out;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 3em;
      animation: slideDown 1s ease-in-out forwards;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 1.2em;
      margin-top: 10px;
      animation: slideUp 1s ease-in-out forwards;
      animation-delay: 0.5s;
      opacity: 0;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; }
      to { opacity: 1; }
    }

    @keyframes slideDown {
      from { transform: translateY(-50px); opacity: 0; }
      to { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; }
    }

    @keyframes slideUp {
      from { transform: translateY(50px); opacity: 0; }
      to { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Thank You!</h1>
    <p>Thanks for following my TikTok: <strong>@_yaziz</strong></p>
    <p>You’re part of this anime journey!</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
